# Markets Dashboard

Before making changes, read `HANDOFF.md` for full project state, architecture, sources, and pending setup.

## Quick facts

- Personal RSS aggregator deployed on Vercel: https://github.com/lucas-rivelli/markets-dashboard
- Sources live in `api/feed.js` (`SOURCES` array)
- Feed merge logic: `lib/aggregate.js`
- UI: `index.html` (vanilla JS, white Substack-style theme)
- Local dev: `npm run dev` (port 3000) — not `vercel dev`

## Conventions

- Commit and push to `main` after every source or feature change (Vercel auto-deploys)
- Do not add X/Twitter RSS bridges — bookmarks use birdclaw → `data/bookmarks.json`
- Spotify needs Vercel env vars (`SPOTIFY_*`); see HANDOFF.md setup section
